  <ferc:DisclosureOfSignificantChangesInAccountingMethodsTextBlock id="HHDA140C5C60AD549A3DC7FFC2AA805B32" contextRef="HH6F430EA68AFC29D1DD829B0DDD45FFF4">&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;None&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfSignificantChangesInAccountingMethodsTextBlock>
  <ferc:DisclosureOfApplicableNotesTextBlock id="HH8533368EB711634BB3DF2FE4E4CB89D5" contextRef="HH6F430EA68AFC29D1DD829B0DDD45FFF4">&lt;div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: sans-serif; font-size: medium;"&gt;
&lt;div style="font-family: sans-serif; font-size: medium; text-align: center;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold; line-height: 18.4px;"&gt;NOTES TO FINANCIAL STATEMENTS&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style="font-family: sans-serif; font-size: medium; text-indent: 189.2pt; text-align: center;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; font-weight: bold; line-height: 15.3333px;"&gt;For the Three Months Ended March 31, 2026&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style="font-family: sans-serif; font-size: medium;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style="font-family: sans-serif; font-size: medium;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 15.3333px;"&gt;These interim financial statements should be read in conjunction with the financial statements and notes thereto contained in the Form 2 of Sabal Trail Transmission, LLC (Sabal Trail) for the year ended December 31, 2025. These financial statements are unaudited, but in management&amp;#8217;s opinion, reflect all normal recurring adjustments that are necessary for a fair presentation of financial position, results of operations and cash flows for the period presented. The results as presented for this interim period are not necessarily indicative of results to be achieved for the full year. Certain information and notes which would substantially duplicate the disclosures contained in the most recent FERC Form 2 have been omitted.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style="font-family: sans-serif; font-size: medium;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style="font-family: sans-serif; font-size: medium;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 14.9333px;"&gt;Previous Form 2 disclosures indicated all system balancing gas was recorded under the inventory method, however, the Company has been consistently using the fixed asset method as defined in FERC Order 581 and will disclose appropriately in the 2023 Form 2. There are no impacts to our current or historical financial statements.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfApplicableNotesTextBlock>
  <ferc:ReportYearPeriod id="HH6439FA2135BC4FC31DA52CEDA67ED097" contextRef="HH6F430EA68AFC29D1DD829B0DDD45FFF4">2026/Q1</ferc:ReportYearPeriod>
  <ferc:StatementAboutImportantChangesDuringTheQuarterYearTextBlock id="HHFF9F4E3640A578CDF5DE55A091A9A0F9" contextRef="HH6F430EA68AFC29D1DD829B0DDD45FFF4">&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;None&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:StatementAboutImportantChangesDuringTheQuarterYearTextBlock>
  <ferc:DisclosureOfAcquisitionOfOwnershipInOtherCompaniesByReorganizationMergerOrConsolidationWithOtherCompaniesTextBlock id="HH9BC0EFBCB25FD35BD21CC5095A000F66" contextRef="HH6F430EA68AFC29D1DD829B0DDD45FFF4">&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;None&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfAcquisitionOfOwnershipInOtherCompaniesByReorganizationMergerOrConsolidationWithOtherCompaniesTextBlock>
  <ferc:DisclosureOfEstimatedAnnualEffectAndNatureOfAnyImportantWageScaleChangesTextBlock id="HHEBA1CD44839C108D1DAFD6DE3427BE45" contextRef="HH6F430EA68AFC29D1DD829B0DDD45FFF4">&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 10.5pt;"&gt;On July 18, 2018, in Docket No. PL17-1-001, the Federal Energy Regulatory Commission (&amp;#8220;Commission&amp;#8221;) dismissed the requests for rehearing and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 10.5pt;"&gt;clarification of its revised policy statement on treatment of income taxes (&amp;#8220;Revised Policy Statement&amp;#8221;) and provided guidance regarding the treatment of &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 10.5pt;"&gt;accumulated deferred income taxes (&amp;#8220;ADIT&amp;#8221;) in light of its revised policy. Inquiry Regarding the Commission&amp;#8217;s Policy for Recovery of Income Tax Costs, Order &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 10.5pt;"&gt;on Rehearing of Revised Policy Statement, 164 FERC &amp;#182; 61,030 (Jul. 18, 2018) (&amp;#8220;July 18 Order&amp;#8221;). Pursuant to the guidance provided by the Commission in its &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 10.5pt;"&gt;July 18 Order, Sabal Trail Transmission, LLC, a tax pass-through entity owned in part by Spectra Energy Partners, LP, a master limited partnership, intends &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 10.5pt;"&gt;to remove any balances recorded in Accounts 190, 281, 282, and 283 of the Commission&amp;#8217;s Uniform System of Accounts, as well as excess ADIT that has &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 10.5pt;"&gt;been transferred to Account 254 and deficient ADIT that has been transferred to Account 182.3. Sabal Trail Transmission, LLC has requested approval from &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 10.5pt;"&gt;the Chief Accountant of the Federal Energy Regulatory Commission to implement the accounting entries necessary for removing these balances. Upon &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 10.5pt;"&gt;receipt of the Chief Accountant&amp;#8217;s approval, Sabal Trail Transmission, LLC will reflect the removal of these balances in the annual and quarterly financing &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 10.5pt;"&gt;reporting required by Part 260 of the Commission&amp;#8217;s regulations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfEstimatedAnnualEffectAndNatureOfAnyImportantWageScaleChangesTextBlock>
  <ferc:DisclosureOfSignificantEventThatRespondentParticipatesInACashManagementProgramsTextBlock id="HHD790CCB2EDB33AB49E3957CEAFD4E7D7" contextRef="HH6F430EA68AFC29D1DD829B0DDD45FFF4">&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;None&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfSignificantEventThatRespondentParticipatesInACashManagementProgramsTextBlock>
